{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11207340","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733001:":{"text":"잘 생각해!","source_cn":"你们可给我想清楚了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE684AFB66C0C6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733002:":{"text":"이게 마지막 기회야!","source_cn":"这是最后一次机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2515C84E609B497","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120734001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">치크</style>, 이건 마지막 경고야.","source_cn":"这是我最后一次警告你，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8931044DA8CCD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120734002:0":{"text":"사막의 발톱은 새로운 두목이 필요해. 그리고 그 두목은 바로 나, 루스야! 지금이라도 내 밑에 들어와서, 내가 게이윌을 꺾고 두목이 되는 걸 도와!","source_cn":"流沙之爪迟早会有新首领——那就是我，鲁斯！你要是现在投...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345C26468D2C13BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120734003:0":{"text":"하지만 여전히 상황파악을 못 한다면… 날 원망하지 말라고!","source_cn":"但要是不知好歹，就别怪我不顾念以前的情分了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990A8E0391D9DC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120734004:0":{"text":"치… 치크. 저 말을 들을 거야…?","source_cn":"奇……奇克，你、你要答应他吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D6C9735FC2AC958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120734005:1":{"text":"아니요, 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"不。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC74AE3C4604443D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120734006:0":{"text":"전에도 말했지만, 나와 루마는 우리만의 길을 가겠어. 그리고 사막의 발톱도 지난 과오를 반복해선 안 돼.","source_cn":"我说过了，我和卢玛有自己的路要走。流沙之爪也不能再重复...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADC39ED22D02ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120734007:0":{"text":"난 게이윌이든 너든, 다 돕지 않겠어!","source_cn":"所以无论是你还是吉维尔，我都不会帮的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DCCD25BB401DE93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120734008:0":{"text":"큭큭, 좋아. 그럼 날 원망하지 마!","source_cn":"好，那就别怪我不念旧情，提前扼杀风险了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4D75988E57C708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120734009:0":{"text":"사막의 발톱 녀석들, 루마 일행을 공격하고 있어요!","source_cn":"那些流沙之爪，要对卢玛他们动手！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1395802C7CABB59D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사막의 발톱 녀석들, 루마 일행을 공격하고 있어요!","female":"사막의 발톱 녀석들, 루마 일행을 공격하고 있어요!","variant_male_record_index":"124652","variant_female_record_index":"124653","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120734010:0":{"text":"도와야 해요!","source_cn":"得阻止他们！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C24920A07D8BC62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도와야 해요!","female":"도와야 해요!","variant_male_record_index":"124654","variant_female_record_index":"124655","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1101020731:0":{"text":"사막의 발톱의 영지에서 흉악한 트라이브가 치크와 루마를 위협했다.","source_cn":"流沙之爪的营地里，一个凶神恶煞的蛮血正在威胁奇克和卢玛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BA088AB7D926065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流沙之爪鲁斯":{"text":"루스","source":"流沙之爪鲁斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢玛":{"text":"루마","source":"卢玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇克":{"text":"치크","source":"奇克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":6}}